WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.598
One light.

00:00:00.598 --> 00:00:01.196
One snook.

00:00:01.196 --> 00:00:03.289
Watch the bright patch under the bridge.

00:00:03.289 --> 00:00:05.382
That little lure is crossing it now.

00:00:05.382 --> 00:00:06.578
The fish hangs back.

00:00:06.578 --> 00:00:08.074
One flick of the tail.

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:08.672
Another twitch.

00:00:08.672 --> 00:00:09.868
Closer to the light.

00:00:09.868 --> 00:00:11.961
Keep your eyes on that silver stripe.

00:00:11.961 --> 00:00:13.157
Here comes the turn.

00:00:13.157 --> 00:00:13.456
Now!

00:00:13.456 --> 00:00:14.652
Straight into the splash.

00:00:14.652 --> 00:00:15.550
What an ambush!
